WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,870 --> 00:00:07,870
Ah Ling, your distinguished guest brought it to you

2
00:00:09,070 --> 00:00:13,260
She seems to be selling classmate Lu more than last time

3
00:00:13,580 --> 00:00:18,340
I heard you were injured again today. It doesn't matter. Don't tell me.

4
00:00:18,340 --> 00:00:19,860
This time I saw a real person

5
00:00:19,860 --> 00:00:20,820
He's really not ugly

6
00:00:20,820 --> 00:00:23,340
Especially when you may have fallen out of love and been betrayed by your friends

7
00:00:23,340 --> 00:00:24,780
Looks like he must have suffered a lot

8
00:00:24,780 --> 00:00:27,020
The whole person is light and clean

9
00:00:27,020 --> 00:00:28,060
that's good

10
00:00:28,060 --> 00:00:30,750
Classmate Lu, I’m fine

11
00:00:30,750 --> 00:00:32,690
I just heard about your recent brother

12
00:00:32,690 --> 00:00:33,730
Ran here rashly today

13
00:00:33,730 --> 00:00:35,730
Because I noticed that you seem to have moved to a new school

14
00:00:35,730 --> 00:00:37,650
Thinking maybe this is the only place where I can find you

15
00:00:37,890 --> 00:00:38,850
what happened at school

16
00:00:38,850 --> 00:00:40,570
I admit that I do have a little sense of boundaries

17
00:00:40,570 --> 00:00:42,770
But Jiang Muye’s chat records are all fake.

18
00:00:42,770 --> 00:00:44,930
What I regret most is that I shouldn’t have talked about her project

19
00:00:44,930 --> 00:00:47,010
Just because I really like that necklace so much

20
00:00:47,010 --> 00:00:48,530
And I was drunk with nine watts of wine

21
00:00:48,530 --> 00:00:50,250
I shouldn’t let Jiang Mu carry me either

22
00:00:50,250 --> 00:00:51,330
But in my heart

23
00:00:51,330 --> 00:00:53,290
You really are my best best friend

24
00:00:53,290 --> 00:00:55,690
I don't know why things turned out like this

25
00:00:55,690 --> 00:00:56,610
let me promise

26
00:00:56,610 --> 00:00:58,730
I will definitely pay attention to my caution in the future

27
00:00:58,730 --> 00:01:00,290
I won't make you unhappy anymore

28
00:01:00,290 --> 00:01:02,330
can you forgive me i'm sorry
